  <Strings>
    <Section>Npc</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304688</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わしのせがれは戦場で、
悪らつな鉛の凶弾に
襲われて死んだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My boy was struck by an
assassin's bullet on the
battlefield. It killed him.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304688</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わしのかみさんは
せがれが死んだことを
信じられず１２年も待った</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My missus waited for 'im
for twelve years. She just
didn't believe he'd really died.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>かみさんはせがれを
待ち続けたが
帰ってこなかった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My missus waited and
waited for our boy, but
he just never came home.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>帰ってくるはずがない、
そうわかっていても、それは
残酷すぎる一言だったのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I knew he wouldn't,
but I couldn't tell her
that. It'd be too cruel.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304696</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>死んだせがれを待ち続けた
わしのかみさんは、
せがれが死んで１３年目のある日、</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And then, in the thirteenth year
since our boy had died, my missus,
after waiting for him all that time...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304696</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>玄関の扉に向かって
何度もせがれの名前を叫んだ。
「帰ってきたんだ」と</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...turned to the entryway and
screamed out his name, over and
over, and said he'd come back.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304696</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>かみさんの目は、
普通じゃなかった……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There was somethin'
wrong with her eyes...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304700</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>かみさんの心は
せがれのところへ
行っちまった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And her heart
left here, and
went to meet him.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304700</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうすれば……あいつの心は
わしの元へ戻ってくる？
わからん、わからんのじゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What could I even do to make
her heart come back here, to me?
I don't know. I just don't know.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304704</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……うちのかみさんは……
死んだ、せがれを……
かみさん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...My missus...
Our dead boy...
My missus...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304704</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>かみさん？　かみさんとは
誰じゃ……せがれ……
せがれなんてわしにはいない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Missus? Who's
that...? My boy? I
never had a son...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うぅ……頭が……
頭が痛い……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uugh... My head...
My head hurts...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304708</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何も思いだせん……
わしは一体、誰……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can't remember... Not a
damn thing... Who am I...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304712</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私はここの家のおじいさんの
世話をしているの……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm caring for the old
man who lives here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304712</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ずっと昔の記憶に
苦しめられていて
おじいさん、とても可哀想……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He's always tortured by
memories from long, long
ago. I feel so awful for him...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304716</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>楽しいお話を毎日、
聞かせて、おじいさんの心を
落ち着けているの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I try to tell him about
happier things, every day,
and set his heart at ease.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304716</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、私が話をしている間、
ずっとうわの空……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, however many things
I tell him about, he's never
really fully present...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>死んだ息子さんと、
奥さんのことを今でも
色々と思い返しているの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even now, he's always thinking
back on his late son and his wife.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304720</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>可哀想なおじいさん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I feel so awful...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、私、知ってるの……
本当は息子さんも奥さんも
生きてるってこと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, I know... The truth
his, both his son and his
wife are still alive...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304724</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当はおじいさん、何年も前に
色々な事情で奥さんたちに
自分ん家から追い出されてるの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In truth—and there were many reasons
for it—he was chased out of his own
home by the two of them, years ago.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304728</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おじいさん、すっかり、
何も思い出せなくなって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And now he doesn't
remember any of it...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304728</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よほどつらい思い出だったのね、
あんまりだわ……あんまり……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It must have been an incredibly
painful memory... Too much so...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私、見るに忍びないの……
いつまでもこの状態で生きて
いかなきゃならないなんて</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I just can't bear to watch him
like this... Why's he have to go
on living, even in the state he's in?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もう、いいのよ……
静かに眠って……
おじい、さん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's...fine... You
should...rest in
peace...now...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この村に来たら、
お金が手に入るって
聞いたんだう～ん♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mmm... I heard if I came to
this village, I could really
rake in the money! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304736</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お金はそこそこあるけど
もっとお金がほしいから
この村に来たんだう～ん♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mmm... My savings are pretty healthy
already, but when I heard I could make
even more, of course I had to come! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>世界お金持ちクラブに
入るためにお金持ちに
なるんだう～ん♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mmm... I'll make even more
money, and then I'll join the
Worldly Wealthy Rich Club! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>総資産が１０００億ガルドないと
世界お金持ちクラブには
入れないんだう～ん∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mmm... You need 100,000,000,000
Gald, as a bare minimum, to join
the Worldly Wealthy Rich Club! ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304744</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>セレブ友達たちが
ここの村はたくさんお金が
手に入るって言うから来たすけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I came to this village because
my celebrity friends said I could
rake in tons of money here, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304744</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ペタおかしすね～
何でここがいいのか、
まったくわからないんだうーん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mmm. It's totes weird~ I
don't have the slightest idea
how to make money here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304748</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>土くさくて、
とても悲しひす</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's so, like,
dirty and sad.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304748</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、もう少し
いるんだう～ん☆</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mmm... But I'll stay
just a little longer. ☆</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304752</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見つけた、見つけたんだう～ん、
お金が手に入る方法だぉの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I found it, I found it, mmm... I
found a way to make moneyyyyy.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304752</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも教えないすよ、
これは私だけのものだう～ん♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mmm... But I won't tell you.
It's meant for me alone! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほくほくほく……
誰にも教えないだう～ん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mmm... Kekekekekeke...
I won't tell a single soul!</EnglishText>
      <Notes>she uses a super weird laugh
so</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304756</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>教えたらお金が逃げるんだって
教えられたんだう～ん∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mmm... 'cause they told me if I tell
anyone else, the money'll run away! ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うちの嬢ちゃん、だう～んとかって
やめろって言ってんだけど
聞きゃしないのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Milady is constantly making that
"mmm..." sound, and I told her
to stop, but she doesn't listen.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バカっぽくない？
一体、何のマネなのかしら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Doesn't she sound stupid?
I wonder what in the world
she thinks she's playing at?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>またこの人、
おかしな連中に
騙されてるのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Once again, she's being
fooled by some some
strange group of people.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やめときなって言ったって
聞きゃしないんだから、
結局、ついてきちゃったわよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I tell her to stop and she
just doesn't listen, so in the
end, I followed her here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304768</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何もしないでお金もらえるなんて
そんな都合のいい話なんて
ないっての……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I keep telling her all these stories
she hears about "easy money" are
just too good to be true, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304768</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うちの嬢ちゃんは本当に
都合がいいって言うか、
頭が悪いっていうか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, they *are* too good to
be true, but milady's brain is
also too *bad* to be true.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304772</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>汗して働くつもりとか
ないのかしらね
じっとしててどうするつもりだか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder if she won't actually do some
work for once. What does she hope
to achieve just standing around?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304772</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、嬢ちゃんが動くと
被害がでかくなるから、何も教えてはあげないの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But whenever she makes a move, it
just leads to even bigger problems,
so she won't hear a peep from me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>嬢ちゃん……
騙されてるわよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Milady... You're
being fooled...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>誰に何を吹き込まれたか、
知らないけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I don't know just who
told you what, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304780</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>困った、嬢ちゃん……
きっとまた大枚はたいて、
変なもん買わされたんだわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh dear... I'm sure milady's once
again bought some strange trinket,
and for another exorbitant price...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>304780</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……あ～ぁ、もう……
今度は何も教えてくれないし
もうほとほと困った子ね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Aaahh, I'm sick of this... She won't
tell me a single word about it, either.
I swear, this girl is utterly hopeless...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
